==Ladino==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|lad|uay|sc=Latn}}

===Interjection===
{{lad-intj|l|heb=גואי}}

# [[woe]]!

====Derived terms====
* {{l|lad|guay de|sc=Latn}}
* {{l|lad|guay de mí|sc=Latn}}
* {{l|lad|guaya|sc=Latn}}
Guai, in Italian, means "woe".
Guay, in Spanish, is nearest in meaning to "wow!" and is used to indicate approval, e.g. "¡Esta música es muy guay!" "This music is really fantastic!"
